Common Test Setup
    [Documentation]  Prepares testing environment before test case execution. By default checks, whether BTS reached onAir state.
    ...              If any preparation step fails or unallowed alarms are detected then test case execution will be aborted.
    ...              IMPORTANT! Whenever "gNB" is mentioned here it also includes tested BTS with only LTE RAT configured on it (LTE only).
    ...
    ...              ARGS:
    ...              - ues (list(UE)): configuration objects from init file of UEs which should be reserved and used during L3 call in executed test case;
    ...                                defaults to: None (no UEs will be reserved nor used);
    ...                                recommended value: not None if test case will perform L3 call, None otherwise
    ...              - access_point_names (dict(str, str)): pairs of UE serial number and desired APN to be configured on it;
    ...                                                     i.e. {"HZQN1876BAKC2300264": "5GWROSA",
    ...                                                           "fe2c6c0c": "5GWROSA"};
    ...                                                     mandatory for NSA+SA mode;
    ...                                                     defaults to: None (APN will not be changed on any UE);
    ...                                                     recommended value: not None for NSA+SA mode or if APN must be changed for other reason, None otherwise
    ...              - btslog (bool): defines whether btslog (syslog) should be collected from gNB during test case execution;
    ...                               defaults to: True (btslog from gNB will be collected);
    ...                               recommended value: True
    ...              - gnb_slave_btslog (bool): defines whether btslog (syslog) should be collected from slave part of Fullrack gNB during test case execution;
    ...                                         defaults to: False (btslog from slave gNB part will not be collected);
    ...                                         recommended value: True for Fullrack configuration, False otherwise
    ...              - enb_btslog (bool): defines whether btslog (syslog) should be collected from remote eNB during test case execution;
    ...                                   defaults to: False (btslog from remote eNB will not be collected);
    ...                                   recommended value: True for NSA mode, False otherwise
    ...              - enable_rmod_logs_to_btslog (bool): defines whether RMOD logs should be sent to BTSLog in real time during test suite execution;
    ...                                                   it will be enabled for RMODs present in current suite setup SCF, please use enable_rmod_logs_to_btslog
    ...                                                   in test setup in case of custom SCF file for specific test;
    ...                                                   defaults to: False (RMOD logs will not be sent to BTSLog);
    ...                                                   recommended value: False
    ...              - enabling_rmod_logs_to_btslog_custom_settings (dict): custom settings for enabling RMOD logs handover to BTSLog,
    ...                                                                     where key is configuration RMOD ID (string) and value is a list with
    ...                                                                     custom rad commands to be executed on RMOD (via FHNET connection)
    ...                                                                     or None if default commands should be used (default values only CPRI and eCPRI RMODs);
    ...                                                                     i.e. {'1': ['rad -mpw 0x10041 2', 'rad -mpw 0x10042 3232300926', 'rad -mpw 0x10043 51000'],
    ...                                                                           '2': ['rad -mpw 0x1003f 1', 'rad -mpw 0x10040 1', 'rad -mpw 0x10041 0x2',
    ...                                                                                 'rad -mpw 0x10042 0xAC150002', 'rad -mpw 0x10043 0xC738', 'rad -mpw 0x10045 0xF00000'],
    ...                                                                           '3': None}
    ...                                                                     defaults to: None (default commands will be used for all RMODs);
    ...                                                                     recommended value: None
    ...              - ue_reboot (bool or str): defines whether UEs should be rebooted during reservation and which method should be used to do it;
    ...                                         i.e. False - no reboot will be done, adb - ADB reboot will be done, ute - UTE lib reboot will be done;
    ...                                         defaults to: False (no UE reboot will be done);
    ...                                         recommended value: False
    ...              - custom_tl (TestLine): further referenced to as "test custom init";
    ...                                      temporarily replaces testline (tl) configuration from either default init (provided via 'robot -V /path/to/init') or suite custom init (if used)
    ...                                      with testline configuration from custom init for the duration of single test case execution;
    ...                                      gets replaced back by previous init, either default init or suite custom init (if used), after test case execution;
    ...                                      test custom init content must be a subset of default init content if validate_configuration_file is enabled;
    ...                                      if default init consists of RMODs that are not listed in test custom init,
    ...                                      then those unused RMODs will be powered off during commissioning;
    ...                                      i.e. ${tl_abip_ahgb};
    ...                                      defaults to: None (test custom init will not be used);
    ...                                      recommended value: None
    ...              - fail_when_no_onair (bool): defines whether test setup should fail if BTS doesn't reach onAir state;
    ...                                           False is used mostly with test cases which operates in Test Dedicated State (TDS);
    ...                                           defaults to: True (test setup will fail if BTS doesn't reach onAir);
    ...                                           recommended value: False if test case expects Test Dedicated State (TDS) active, True otherwise
    ...              - collect_pcap (bool): defines whether tcpdump.pcap should be collected from gNB SMOD;
    ...                                     probably deprecated and collect_tcpdump should be used instead;
    ...                                     defaults to: False (tcpdump.pcap from gNB SMOD will not be collected);
    ...                                     recommended value: False
    ...              - check_alds_online_status (bool): defines whether ALDs online status should be checked;
    ...                                                 defaults to: False (ALDs status will not be checked);
    ...                                                 recommended value: True if ALDs are present, False otherwise
    ...              - attenuator_info (Attenuator): configuration object from init file of attenuator which will be used during L3 call performed on supercell;
    ...                                              i.e. ${tl.attenuators[0]}
    ...                                              defaults to: None (attenuator will not be used);
    ...                                              recommended value: not None if L3 call will be performed on supercell, None otherwise
    ...              - attenuator_config (dict(str, dict)): configuration of attenuator ports paired with RMOD antennas which will be used
    ...                                                     during L3 call performed on supercell;
    ...                                                     i.e.
    ...                                                     {"MRBTS-50109/NRBTS-50109/NRCELL-1": {"Subcell-0": [{"antenna": "RMOD-1/ANTL-1", "port": 0, "OFF": 0, "ON": 0},
    ...                                                                                                         {"antenna": "RMOD-1/ANTL-5", "port": 0, "OFF": 0, "ON": 0}],
    ...                                                                                           "Subcell-1": [{"antenna": "RMOD-2/ANTL-1", "port": 0, "OFF": 0, "ON": 0},
    ...                                                                                                         {"antenna": "RMOD-2/ANTL-5", "port": 0, "OFF": 0, "ON": 0}]}}
    ...                                                     defaults to: None (attenuator will not be used);
    ...                                                     recommended value: not None if L3 call will be performed on supercell, None otherwise
    ...              - custom_scf_name (str): name of custom SCF file (without .xml extension) for this testline from
    ...                                       gears repository or full path to custom SCF file which will be
    ...                                       used to recommission gNB;
    ...                                       i.e. /home/ute/my_custom_scf/config_files/5G_custom_scf.xml
    ...                                       or   SCF_SISOAUTO024_8562_8990_10890_SBTS_master
    ...                                       defaults to: None (gNB recommissioning will not be performed);
    ...                                       recommended value: None
    ...              - custom_scf_name_lte (str): name of custom SCF file (without .xml extension) for this testline from
    ...                                           gears repository or full path to custom SCF file which will be used
    ...                                           to recommission remote eNB;
    ...                                           i.e. /home/ute/my_custom_scf/config_files/LTE_custom_scf.xml
    ...                                           or   SCF_SISOAUTO024_8562_8990_10890_SBTS_master_lte
    ...                                           defaults to: None (eNB recommissioning will not be performed);
    ...                                           recommended value: None
    ...              - optical_switch_settings (dict or list(dict)): configurations of optical switches to be set before commissioning;
    ...                                                              i.e. {"optical_switch_id": 0, "module_number": 1, "output_channel": 2}
    ...                                                              or [{"optical_switch_id": 0, "module_number": 1, "output_channel": 2},
    ...                                                                  {"optical_switch_id": 0, "module_number": 2, "output_channel": 3}]
    ...                                                defaults to: None (optical switch configuration will not be changed);
    ...                                                recommended value: None
    ...              - btslog_storage_path (str): directory path where btslog will be stored during test case execution;
    ...                                           customized mostly for long term testing when btslog has potential to use up all
    ...                                           available storeage place in defulat /tmp directory;
    ...                                           i.e. /home/ute/btslog
    ...                                           defaults to: /tmp/btslog2 (default btslog storage path);
    ...                                           recommended value: /tmp/btslog2
    ...              - collect_tcpdump (bool): defines whether tcpdump.pcap should be collected from gNB SMOD during test case execution;
    ...                                        defaults to: False (tcpdump.pcap from gNB SMOD will not be collected);
    ...                                        recommended value: False
    ...              - tcpdump_interface (str): interface for tcpdump collection to be used if collect_tcpdump is True;
    ...                                         defaults to: any;
    ...                                         recommended value: any
    ...              - tcpdump_remote_file_path (str): absolute path on gNB SMOD for collected tcpdump file to be used if collect_tcpdump is True;
    ...                                                customized mostly when during test case execution there will be SMOD reset and /tmp isn't safe;
    ...                                                defaults to: /tmp/test_setup_tcpdump.pcap (default tcpdump file storage path);
    ...                                                recommended value: /tmp/test_setup_tcpdump.pcap
    ...              - ue_network_modes (dict(str, str)): pairs of UE serial number and desired network mode to be set on it;
    ...                                                   possible UE network modes: 'NR_only', 'LTE_only', 'NR_LTE';
    ...                                                   when using more than one UE choose either only modes with '_only' suffix or
    ...                                                   only 'NR_LTE' - it is not possible to mix those;
    ...                                                   mandatory for NSA+SA mode;
    ...                                                   i.e. {"HZQN1876BAKC2300264": "NR_only",
    ...                                                         "fe2c6c0c": "LTE_only}
    ...                                                   defaults to: None (network mode will not be changed on any UE);
    ...                                                   recommended value: not None for NSA+SA mode or if network mode must be changed for other reason, None otherwise
    ...              - custom_rmod_setup_yaml_path (str): absolute path to custom RMOD console connection setup YAML file. If provided, then custom RMOD console connection setup will be used.
    ...                                                   example YAML file can be found under repository path: taf/hw/rf_diagnostic_card/examples/custom_setup_example.yaml;
    ...                                                   Defaults to None (default RMOD console connection setup will be used);
    ...              - iphy_configs (list): A list of dictionaries for configuring IPHY on BTSs with simulators (e.g., Airphone).
    ...                                     Each dictionary in the list represents one simulator configuration and must contain the following keys:
    ...                                     - `ip` (str): The IP address of the simulator instance.
    ...                                     - `remote_host` (str or None): The remote host for the connection, or `${None}` if not applicable.
    ...                                     - `iphy_file` (str): The absolute path to the `iphy.xml` configuration file for that simulator.
    ...                                     Example (can be created using `Evaluate` keyword or from a variable file):
    ...                                     [{'ip': '192.168.1.1',
    ...                                       'remote_host': None,
    ...                                       'iphy_file': 'some_path'},
    ...                                      {'ip': '192.168.1.129',
    ...                                       'remote_host': '10.2.1.15',
    ...                                       'iphy_file': 'some_path2'}]
    ...                                     Defaults to: `${None}` (IPHY file uploading will be skipped).
    ...                                     Recommended value: None for BTS without simulator, a list of configs otherwise.
    ...              - lua_config_file_path (str): absolute path to .lua or .cfg configuration file for simulator;
    ...                                            if None provided then simulator configuration file uploading will be skipped and BTS with simulator will not reach On Air state;
    ...                                            i.e. ${EXECDIR}/testsuite/Wroclaw/SISO/TestLines/7_16_UTE5GSISOAUTO005/LUA/SISOAUTO005_SBTS_master.lua
    ...                                            defaults to: None (simulator configuration file uploading will be skipped);
    ...                                            recommended value: None for BTS without simulator, .lua or .cfg file path otherwise
    ...             - use_init_credentials_for_rmod_console(bool): defines whether initial credentials from init file should be used for RMOD serial console connections;
    ...                                                            Defaults to: False (taf.config.testline database credentials will be used);
    ...                                                            Recommended value: False
    ...             - oran_plugin_versions (dict): dictionary containing custom O-RAN plugin versions to install on RMODs,
    ...                                            where key is RMOD product code (string) and value is plugin version (string),
    ...                                            i.e. {'475701A.103': 'RFMPlugin_O-RU_NK_475701A-103_0017'}
    ...                                            Defaults to: None means the latest plugin version available on WFT will be used during plugin installation.
    ...                                            Recommended value: None
    ...             - tc_name (str): name of the test case, which may be changed f.ex. when one test case is executed in a loop.
    ...                              defaults to ${TEST_NAME};
    ...                              recommended value ${TEST_NAME}
    ...             - validate_configuration_file (bool): defines whether content of test custom init (if used), should be validated;
    ...                                                   additionally, if test custom init is used, it will be checked, whether its content is a subset of default init content;
    ...                                                   validation must be skipped if testline has simulator (i.e. Airphone);
    ...                                                   defaults to: True (init will be validated);
    ...                                                   recommended value: True for BTS without simulator, False otherwise
